# Density Compare
# Chlorine (Cl) — real density 0.0032 g/cm³. equal masses: Chlorine vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Chlorine Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 135.6mm color: #1ff01f at (-20mm, 67.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
